/* VibeBuddyKit — Simplified Chinese (zh-Hans).
   The Kit's own string table (ticket 08, ADR-0017). Every localized string
   and `Text(…)` in the Kit resolves here through `bundle: .module`, so the
   phone, the Mac panel, the Glance, the Watch and the widgets read one
   wording for the shared copy. Keys are the English source text; an
   interpolated `\(n)` in a key becomes `%lld` / `%@`, and a literal percent
   sign in such a key is `%%`. The apps' tables keep their own
   copies of the keys that predate this table (harmless: a Kit call never
   looks in Bundle.main). */

